000010* USE GLOBAL: an outer program's USE AFTER ERROR procedures
000020* handle I/O errors in nested programs, both for a GLOBAL file
000030* and by open mode for a nested program's own file. The CALLs
000040* are inside a PERFORMed paragraph, so the outer PERFORM must
000050* survive the nested programs coming back into the outer one.
000060 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000070 PROGRAM-ID. USEGLOB.
000080 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000090 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000100 FILE-CONTROL.
000110     SELECT SHARED-F ASSIGN TO "shared.dat"
000120        ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS FS-S.
000130 DATA DIVISION.
000140 FILE SECTION.
000150 FD SHARED-F IS GLOBAL.
000160 01 S-REC          PIC X(10).
000170 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000180 01 FS-S           PIC XX GLOBAL.
000190 01 HANDLED        PIC 99 VALUE 0 GLOBAL.
000200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000210 DECLARATIVES.
000220 SHARED-ERR SECTION.
000230     USE GLOBAL AFTER ERROR PROCEDURE ON SHARED-F.
000240 SHARED-ERR-PARA.
000250     ADD 1 TO HANDLED
000260     DISPLAY "  OUTER HANDLER FOR SHARED-F, STATUS " FS-S.
000270 INPUT-ERR SECTION.
000280     USE GLOBAL AFTER ERROR PROCEDURE ON INPUT.
000290 INPUT-ERR-PARA.
000300     ADD 1 TO HANDLED
000310     DISPLAY "  OUTER HANDLER FOR INPUT".
000320 END DECLARATIVES.
000330 MAIN SECTION.
000340 MAIN-PARA.
000350     DISPLAY "OUTER: READ SHARED-F WITHOUT OPEN"
000360     READ SHARED-F
000370     PERFORM CALL-INNERS
000380     DISPLAY "BACK IN MAIN AFTER THE PERFORM"
000390     DISPLAY "HANDLED " HANDLED
000400     STOP RUN.
000410 CALL-INNERS.
000420     CALL "INNER1"
000430     CALL "INNER2"
000440     DISPLAY "END OF CALL-INNERS".
000450 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000460 PROGRAM-ID. INNER1.
000470 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000480     DISPLAY "INNER1: OPEN INPUT SHARED-F (MISSING)"
000490     OPEN INPUT SHARED-F
000500     DISPLAY "INNER1: STATUS " FS-S
000510     GOBACK.
000520 END PROGRAM INNER1.
000530 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000540 PROGRAM-ID. INNER2.
000550 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000560 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000570 FILE-CONTROL.
000580     SELECT OWN-F ASSIGN TO "own.dat"
000590        ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS FS-O.
000600 DATA DIVISION.
000610 FILE SECTION.
000620 FD OWN-F.
000630 01 O-REC          PIC X(10).
000640 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000650 01 FS-O           PIC XX.
000660 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000670     DISPLAY "INNER2: OPEN INPUT OWN-F (MISSING)"
000680     OPEN INPUT OWN-F
000690     DISPLAY "INNER2: STATUS " FS-O
000700     GOBACK.
000710 END PROGRAM INNER2.
000720 END PROGRAM USEGLOB.
